    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 The following should be punishable as ordinary crimes:",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-currency-act-1981.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-currency-act-1981.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAny fraudulent making or altering of currency, whatever means are\nemployed;\n(2)\nThe fraudulent uttering of counterfeit currency;\n\nSchedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency\n\nCrimes (Currency) Act 1981\n\nCompilation date: 11/5/18\nRegistered: 23/5/18\n\n(3)\nThe introduction into a country of or the receiving or obtaining\ncounterfeit currency with a view to uttering the same and with\nknowledge that it is counterfeit;\n(4)\nAttempts to commit, and any intentional participation in, the\nforegoing acts;\n(5)\nThe fraudulent making, receiving or obtaining of instruments or\nother articles peculiarly adapted for the counterfeiting or altering of\ncurrency.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nAny fraudulent making or altering of currency, whatever means are\nemployed;\n(2)\nThe fraudulent uttering of counterfeit currency;\n\nSchedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency\n\nCrimes (Currency) Act 1981\n\nCompilation date: 11/5/18\nRegistered: 23/5/18\n\n(3)\nThe introduction into a country of or the receiving or obtaining\ncounterfeit currency with a view to uttering the same and with\nknowledge that it is counterfeit;\n(4)\nAttempts to commit, and any intentional participation in, the\nforegoing acts;\n(5)\nThe fraudulent making, receiving or obtaining of instruments or\nother articles peculiarly adapted for the counterfeiting or altering of\ncurrency.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3eef569782462536323593b29df94aeba9f5948ec1bd927b232e0e64d53421dd",
      "skos:note": "Counterfeiting and related activities are prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 The following should be punishable as ordinary crimes:",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAny fraudulent making or altering of currency, whatever means are\nemployed;\n(2)\nThe fraudulent uttering of counterfeit currency;\n\nSchedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency\n\nCrimes (Currency) Act 1981\n\nCompilation date: 11/5/18\nRegistered: 23/5/18\n\n(3)\nThe introduction into a country of or the receiving or obtaining\ncounterfeit currency with a view to uttering the same and with\nknowledge that it is counterfeit;\n(4)\nAttempts to commit, and any intentional participation in, the\nforegoing acts;\n(5)\nThe fraudulent making, receiving or obtaining of instruments or\nother articles peculiarly adapted for the counterfeiting or altering of\ncurrency."
    },
