      "values:originalText": "(3) Details of discoveries of forgeries, stating whether it has been possible\nto seize all counterfeit currency put into circulation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-14-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
