    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-21",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21 After the 1st day of January 1930, the present Convention shall be open to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "accession on behalf of any Member of the League of Nations and any of the\nnon-member States referred to in Article 20 on whose behalf it has not been\nsigned.\nThe instruments of accession shall be transmitted to the Secretary-General\nof the League of Nations, who will notify their receipt to all the Members of the\nLeague and to the non-member States referred to in Article 20."
    },
