    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23 Schedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-23"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-currency-act-1981.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-currency-act-1981.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "Crimes (Currency) Act 1981\n\nCompilation date: 11/5/18\nRegistered: 23/5/18\n\nRatification of or accession to the present Convention by any High\nContracting Party implies that its legislation and its administrative organisation\nare in conformity with the rules contained in the Convention.",
      "skos:definition": "Crimes (Currency) Act 1981\n\nCompilation date: 11/5/18\nRegistered: 23/5/18\n\nRatification of or accession to the present Convention by any High\nContracting Party implies that its legislation and its administrative organisation\nare in conformity with the rules contained in the Convention.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e61733c0c9bafa0aff0cc1bdab4cc42448a0d3fbfed7580d2feb2bfff1e45f70",
      "skos:note": "Ratification implies conformity with Convention rules"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-23",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23 Schedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "Crimes (Currency) Act 1981\n\nCompilation date: 11/5/18\nRegistered: 23/5/18\n\nRatification of or accession to the present Convention by any High\nContracting Party implies that its legislation and its administrative organisation\nare in conformity with the rules contained in the Convention."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Ratification implies obligation to conform",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Ratification of Convention",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Conformity with Convention rules"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-24",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24 In the absence of a contrary declaration by one of the High Contracting",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-24"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-currency-act-1981.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-currency-act-1981.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "Parties at the time of signature, ratification or accession, the provisions of the\npresent Convention shall not apply to colonies, overseas territories,\nprotectorates or territories under suzerainty or mandate.\nNevertheless, the High Contracting Parties reserve the right to accede to\nthe Convention, in accordance with the provisions of Articles 21 and 23, for\ntheir colonies, overseas territories, protectorates or territories under suzerainty\nor mandate. They also reserve the right to denounce it separately in accordance\nwith the provisions of Article 27.",
      "skos:definition": "Parties at the time of signature, ratification or accession, the provisions of the\npresent Convention shall not apply to colonies, overseas territories,\nprotectorates or territories under suzerainty or mandate.\nNevertheless, the High Contracting Parties reserve the right to accede to\nthe Convention, in accordance with the provisions of Articles 21 and 23, for\ntheir colonies, overseas territories, protectorates or territories under suzerainty\nor mandate. They also reserve the right to denounce it separately in accordance\nwith the provisions of Article 27.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-24-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-24-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "82ec9e224d15136d0760d71f9e283214954fd8898421a764777d16e91c743065",
      "skos:note": "Colonies, overseas territories, protectorates or territories under suzerainty or mandate are exempt from the Convention's provisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-24",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24 In the absence of a contrary declaration by one of the High Contracting",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "Parties at the time of signature, ratification or accession, the provisions of the\npresent Convention shall not apply to colonies, overseas territories,\nprotectorates or territories under suzerainty or mandate.\nNevertheless, the High Contracting Parties reserve the right to accede to\nthe Convention, in accordance with the provisions of Articles 21 and 23, for\ntheir colonies, overseas territories, protectorates or territories under suzerainty\nor mandate. They also reserve the right to denounce it separately in accordance\nwith the provisions of Article 27."
    },
    {
