      "values:originalText": "(1) The Government of INDIA make a reservation to the effect that Article\n9 does not apply to India, where the power to legislate is not sufficiently\nextensive to admit of the legislation contemplated by this article.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Government of INDIA make a reservation to the effect that Article\n9 does not apply to India, where the power to legislate is not sufficiently\nextensive to admit of the legislation contemplated by this article.",
