        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-28-ss-2-logic-ltl-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "11b2d3c3b7167aa49f7754873635e845b4cb56f009b2abf6ca9c81685ea0c163",
      "skos:note": "Right of High Contracting Parties to regulate domestic law regarding lighter sentences, pardon, and amnesty. Chinese Government unable to accept extradition of foreigner accused of counterfeiting currency by a third State."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-currency-act-1981#article-28-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28(2) The present Convention shall be registered by the Secretariat of the League",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Pending the negotiation for the abolition of consular jurisdiction which\nis still enjoyed by nationals of some Powers, the CHINESE Government is\nunable to accept Article 10, which involves the general undertaking of a\nGovernment to grant extradition of a foreigner who is accused of counterfeiting\ncurrency by a third State."
